## 4. Validation ladder & parity audit

1. Static: `py_compile`; `FLAC_AR_BFC.json` parse; `bash -n`.
2. Full pytest: §3h + regression set.
3. Tiny synthetic forward: `_compute_conditioning` on synthetic metadata (CPU).
